[{"id":3819241900,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7jpQGs","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"Should be finished now. This is definitely the most intrusive part of the dock rework (compared to bottom panel and other docks), but it also allowed to simplify some parts of the code, like the screens are no longer accessed by name or index, but directly as the docks.\n\nDefinitely needs testing, I'm not 100% sure that all signals and callbacks work the same as before (at least the exposed ones; some internals were changed and are expected to be different). There _is_ some minor compatibility breakage, see my previous comment.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3819241900","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-18T13:26:25Z"},{"id":3813295075,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7jSkPj","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3813295075","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-18T13:27:55Z"},{"id":3820374531,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7jtkoD","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?u=ccfc0c8ff4c980eb77e097aa72e9ad04749294a9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","login":"YeldhamDev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev"},"body":"Placing a tab from a dock section with a different style (e.g. icon-only) results in this:\n\n<img width=\"249\" height=\"31\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e95ed91-649b-479f-b90c-9f272d9227ae\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3820374531","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-18T14:55:57Z"},{"id":3824519417,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7j9Yj5","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3824519417","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-19T09:47:38Z"},{"id":3873749447,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7m5LnH","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"Found some issues:\r\n\r\n3D transform gizmos are broken, they don't show.\r\n\r\nFloating 3D editor right click freelook mouse position is not correct when finishing.\r\n\r\nFloating 2D editor panning is broken.\r\n\r\nClosing or floating all main docks and clicking the main screen's dock context popup button crashes.\r\n\r\nWith the editors floating, it should focus them when they are being edited. For example clicking on a script (from scene dock or filesystem) doesn't open the script editor, and clicking on a 3D node does not bring up the 3D editor. Or if can't focus for some reason at least `window_move_to_foreground`.\r\nThis also applies to 2D and 3D when they are closed, but maybe that is intentional.\r\nBut if that is the case then 2D and 3D editors probably shouldn't open on scene change if they were closed.\r\n\r\nIf the 2D editor is floating or closed then docks like GridMap, TileMap, Animation, Polygon2D, etc don't open.\r\n\r\nThis makes it harder to access the script editor when it is floating since the button is removed. Same with making it floating since its an extra click and in a menu. Not sure if there is anything to be done about it though.\r\n\r\nClosing or floating all main docks shows a big empty space, which is unlike closing other docks. Not sure what to do about it especially since bottom panel can be minimized.\r\n\r\nIts kind of weird to have the tab bar dock context menu button off to the right, far away from the main docks.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1913\" height=\"46\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3806a6f1-cb97-46b0-9376-e0bae064b9fe\" />\r\n\r\nNot sure if it would be better right next to them though.\r\nAnd it may have changed the centering slightly, the logic for it may need to be updated.\r\n\r\nRecovery mode crashes. I'm guessing its related to the Game view not being available.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3873749447","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-09T20:31:36Z"},{"id":3918081785,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7piS75","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3918081785","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-09T20:39:16Z"},{"id":3931703571,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7qWQkT","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-3931703571","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-11T18:42:17Z"},{"id":4950946844,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJxl0HA","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"f2da3f5173b2f491303371846c93144dd1e0a9c5","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"The last remaining issue I had was fixed! This PR looks good from a usability standpoint:\n- If you close a main dock, then you can reopen it using the Editor > Editor Docks menu.\n- If the Game dock is set to float on run, you can leave it out of the tabs at the top. Nice and clean.\n- Ability to reordering the main docks is nice.\n\nVery soon, users will want to be able to split the main dock..... 😏\n\nIn my review, I didn't look at the code. I also didn't look at how backward compatibility is maintained for plugins, and I suspect that'll be important with this PR.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-4950946844","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-17T11:10:15Z"},{"id":4960453433,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6qDOQ","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"f2da3f5173b2f491303371846c93144dd1e0a9c5","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"Breaks window dragging on macOS:\n\n<img width=\"1435\" height=\"66\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c5a7cab-3ff5-4659-908d-6d9727a82f56\" />\n\nPreviously red areas were usable as title bar to drag window, with this PR, only green part can be used. The rest is likely covered by tab control.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-4960453433","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-18T11:27:01Z"},{"id":4964427590,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ-cnRg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f2da3f5173b2f491303371846c93144dd1e0a9c5","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"ScriptEditor and AssetStore need margins. (only when not floating)\n\n<img width=\"967\" height=\"551\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4541fa3-405d-44da-81e2-b05318a3415e\" />\n\n---\n\nIf 2D and 3D is closed then switching to a scene with a 2d root node causes errors like:\n```\n  ERROR: Node not found: \"/root/@EditorNode@20438/@Panel@14/@Control@67/2D/@VBoxContainer@9920/@VSplitContainer@9925/@HSplitContainer@9927/@HSplitContainer@9929/@Control@9930/@SubViewportContainer@9931/@SubViewport@9932/Node2D\" (absolute path attempted from \"/root/@EditorNode@20438/@Panel@14/@VBoxContainer@16/DockVSplitMain/DockHSplitMain/DockVSplitLeftR/DockSlotLeftUR/Scene/@VBoxContainer@5305/@MarginContainer@5368/@SceneTreeEditor@5412\").\n```\n\n---\n\nWhen reloading the editor and the open scene has a 2d/3d root node, the 2d/3d editor gets opened even if a different one was last open.\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-4964427590","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-18T22:13:40Z"},{"id":4968963423,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKCxdXw","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f2da3f5173b2f491303371846c93144dd1e0a9c5","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316468666?u=363824e44f29d18aad181dbee74a5552243a9b48&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DaveTheEggman","id":316468666,"node_id":"U_kgDOEtztug","login":"DaveTheEggman","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman"},"body":"A few nitpicks, will try to review the implementation & test it later on","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051#pullrequestreview-4968963423","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113051","author_association":"NONE","submitted_at":"2026-08-19T06:22:55Z"},{"id":4969717402,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKDfemg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f2da3f5173b2f491303371846c93144dd1e0a9c5","user